          "content": "# Implementation Plan: Template System → Intelligent Agents\n\n## **Phase 1: Foundation (Week 1-2)**\n\n### **1.1 Fix Current Template System**\n```bash\n# Fix all 8 agents with proper training patterns\n- Fix Roop (Frontend) - separate coordination from code ✅\n- Fix Mool (Backend) - separate coordination from code ✅  \n- Fix Kosh (Database) - extract Prisma schemas\n- Fix Dhar (DevOps) - extract Docker/CI configs\n- Fix Pal (Architecture) - extract system designs\n- Fix Kalp (Design) - extract design tokens\n- Fix Bandh (Security) - extract security configs\n- Fix Gati (Performance) - extract optimization code\n```\n\n### **1.2 Shared Context System**\n```javascript\n// Redis-based context store\nclass ProjectContext {\n  async set(key, value) { await redis.set(`${projectId}:${key}`, value); }\n  async get(key) { return await redis.get(`${projectId}:${key}`); }\n  async notify(event, data) { await redis.publish(`${projectId}:events`, {event, data}); }\n}\n```\n\n## **Phase 2: Requirement Intelligence (Week 3-4)**\n\n### **2.1 Requirement Analyzer**\n```javascript\nclass RequirementAnalyzer {\n  extractEntities(description) {\n    // \"blog with posts and comments\" → [Post, Comment, User, Category]\n    const entities = this.nlpExtraction(description);\n    return entities.map(e => this.normalizeEntity(e));\n  }\n  \n  inferRelationships(entities) {\n    // Post hasMany Comments, User hasMany Posts\n    return this.relationshipInference(entities);\n  }\n  \n  extractBusinessRules(description) {\n    // \"moderated comments\" → approval workflow\n    return this.ruleExtraction(description);\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### **2.2 Entity-Driven Generation**\n```javascript\nclass EntityGenerator {\n  generateSchema(entities, relationships) {\n    return entities.map(entity => \n      this.generatePrismaModel(entity, relationships)\n    );\n  }\n  \n  generateAPIs(entities, businessRules) {\n    return entities.map(entity =>\n      this.generateTRPCRouter(entity, businessRules[entity.name])\n    );\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## **Phase 3: Agent Intelligence (Week 5-6)**\n\n### **3.1 Kosh (Database) Intelligence**\n```javascript\nclass KoshAgent {\n  async generateSchema(requirements) {\n    const analysis = await this.analyzeRequirements(requirements);\n    \n    const models = analysis.entities.map(entity => ({\n      name: entity.name,\n      fields: this.generateFields(entity),\n      relations: this.generateRelations(entity, analysis.relationships),\n      indexes: this.generateIndexes(entity),\n      constraints: this.generateConstraints(entity)\n    }));\n    \n    return this.generatePrismaSchema(models);\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### **3.2 Mool (Backend) Intelligence**\n```javascript\nclass MoolAgent {\n  async generateAPIs(schema, requirements) {\n    const context = await this.getProjectContext();\n    \n    const routers = schema.models.map(model => ({\n      name: model.name.toLowerCase(),\n      operations: this.generateOperations(model, requirements),\n      validation: this.generateValidation(model),\n      permissions: this.generatePermissions(model, requirements),\n      realTime: this.needsRealTime(model, requirements)\n    }));\n    \n    return this.generateTRPCRouters(routers);\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## **Phase 4: Real Coordination (Week 7-8)**\n\n### **4.1 Event-Driven Coordination**\n```javascript\nclass AgentCoordinator {\n  async executeProject(requirements) {\n    // 1. Requirement analysis\n    const analysis = await this.requirementAnalyzer.analyze(requirements);\n    await this.context.set('analysis', analysis);\n    \n    // 2. Schema generation\n    const schema = await this.kosh.generateSchema(analysis);\n    await this.context.set('schema', schema);\n    await this.context.notify('schema-ready', schema);\n    \n    // 3. Parallel API + UI generation\n    const [apis, components] = await Promise.all([\n      this.mool.generateAPIs(schema, analysis),\n      this.roop.generateComponents(analysis, await this.kalp.getDesignSystem())\n    ]);\n    \n    // 4. Integration\n    await this.roop.integrateAPIs(apis);\n    \n    return { schema, apis, components };\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### **4.2 Real-time Agent Communication**\n```javascript\n// Agent subscribes to events\nmool.on('schema-updated', async (schema) => {\n  const updatedAPIs = await mool.updateAPIs(schema);\n  await context.notify('apis-updated', updatedAPIs);\n});\n\nroop.on('apis-updated', async (apis) => {\n  await roop.updateTypeDefinitions(apis);\n});\n```\n\n## **Phase 5: Quality & Testing (Week 9-10)**\n\n### **5.1 Intelligent Testing**\n```javascript\nclass DharAgent {\n  async generateTests(schema, apis, components) {\n    const tests = {\n      unit: this.generateUnitTests(apis),\n      integration: this.generateIntegrationTests(schema, apis),\n      e2e: this.generateE2ETests(components),\n      performance: this.generateLoadTests(apis)\n    };\n    \n    return this.writeTestFiles(tests);\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### **5.2 Security & Performance**\n```javascript\nclass BandhAgent {\n  async securityAudit(code) {\n    const vulnerabilities = await this.scanVulnerabilities(code);\n    const fixes = await this.generateSecurityFixes(vulnerabilities);\n    return { vulnerabilities, fixes };\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## **Phase 6: Production Deployment (Week 11-12)**\n\n### **6.1 Deployment Intelligence**\n```javascript\nclass DharAgent {\n  async deployProject(projectContext) {\n    const config = this.generateDeploymentConfig(projectContext);\n    \n    // Generate based on requirements\n    if (projectContext.needsDatabase) {\n      await this.setupDatabase(config.database);\n    }\n    \n    if (projectContext.needsAuth) {\n      await this.setupAuth(config.auth);\n    }\n    \n    return this.deployToVercel(config);\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## **Implementation Priority:**\n\n### **Week 1-2: Quick Wins**\n1. Fix all 8 agents with proper code extraction\n2. Basic context sharing system\n3. Test with simple projects\n\n### **Week 3-4: Core Intelligence**\n1. Requirement analyzer with entity extraction\n2. Schema generation from entities\n3. API generation from schema\n\n### **Week 5-6: Agent Upgrades**\n1. Intelligent Kosh (database)\n2. Intelligent Mool (backend)\n3. Intelligent Roop (frontend)\n\n### **Week 7-8: Coordination**\n1. Real-time agent communication\n2. Context-aware generation\n3. End-to-end project creation\n\n### **Week 9-10: Quality**\n1. Automated testing generation\n2. Security scanning\n3. Performance optimization\n\n### **Week 11-12: Production**\n1. Deployment automation\n2. Monitoring setup\n3. Documentation generation\n\n## **Success Metrics:**\n\n### **Phase 1 Success:**\n- All 8 agents generate proper code from templates\n- Basic project creation works end-to-end\n\n### **Phase 2 Success:**\n- Can differentiate \"blog\" vs \"e-commerce\" vs \"task manager\"\n- Generates appropriate entities for each domain\n\n### **Phase 3 Success:**\n- Generates custom schemas based on requirements\n- Creates appropriate APIs for generated entities\n\n### **Phase 4 Success:**\n- Agents coordinate in real-time\n- Context is shared and maintained across agents\n\n### **Phase 5 Success:**\n- Automated testing covers generated code\n- Security and performance issues are detected\n\n### **Phase 6 Success:**\n- One-command deployment to production\n- Monitoring and analytics are automatically set up\n\n**Target Score: 80+/100 for production-ready enterprise applications**\n\nShould I start with Phase 1 (fixing the remaining 6 agents)?"
