grations\n│   └── seed.ts                    # Sample data\n└── src/lib/db.ts                  # Database connection\n```\n\n### **Mool (Backend) Generates:**\n```\nprojects/{project-id}/code/src/server/\n├── api/\n│   ├── root.ts                    # Main tRPC router\n│   ├── trpc.ts                    # tRPC configuration\n│   └── routers/\n│       ├── auth.ts                # Authentication APIs\n│       ├── users.ts               # User management\n│       ├── posts.ts               # Post CRUD (for blog)\n│       ├── comments.ts            # Comment CRUD\n│       └── categories.ts          # Category CRUD\n├── auth.ts                        # NextAuth configuration\n└── websocket.ts                   # Real-time features\n```\n\n### **Roop (Frontend) Generates:**\n```\nprojects/{project-id}/code/src/\n├── components/\n│   ├── ui/                        # Base UI components\n│   ├── layouts/                   # Layout components\n│   ├── posts/                     # Post-related components\n│   ├── comments/                  # Comment components\n│   └── auth/                      # Auth components\n├── app/                           # Next.js app router\n├── lib/\n│   ├── utils.ts                   # Utility functions\n│   └── trpc.ts                    # tRPC client setup\n└── styles/\n    └── globals.css                # Global styles\n```\n\n### **Dhar (DevOps) Generates:**\n```\nprojects/{project-id}/code/\n├── tests/\n│   ├── unit/                      # Unit tests\n│   ├── integration/               # API tests\n│   └── e2e/                       # End-to-end tests\n├── docker-compose.yml             # Local development\n├── .github/workflows/             # CI/CD pipelines\n├── .env.example                   # Environment template\n└── README.md                      # Setup instructions\n```\n\n## **Redis Schema & Memory Usage**\n\n### **Redis Key Structure**\n```javascript\n// Project-level data (shared by all agents)\nproject:{projectId} = {\n  requirements: \"Blog with posts and comments\",     // ~1KB\n  created: \"2025-01-01T00:00:00Z\",                 // ~30B\n  status: \"in-progress\"                            // ~20B\n}\n\n// Agent-specific memory\nagent:{agentName}:{projectId} = {\n  conversation: [...],    // ~10KB per agent (50 conversations)\n  decisions: [...],       // ~5KB per agent\n  files: [...],          // ~2KB per agent (file paths only)\n  generated_data: {...}   // Variable size\n}\n\n// Cross-agent coordination\ncoordination:{projectId} = {\n  requests: [...],        // ~5KB (100 requests)\n  responses: [...],       // ~5KB (100 responses)\n  events: [...]          // ~3KB (event log)\n}\n\n// Generated artifacts (cached)\nartifact:{projectId}:{type} = {\n  schema: {...},          // ~10KB (Prisma schema)\n  apis: {...},           // ~15KB (API specifications)\n  components: {...},      // ~20KB (Component specs)\n  design_system: {...}    // ~8KB (Design tokens)\n}\n```\n\n### **Memory Calculation per Project**\n\n#### **Small Project (Blog):**\n```\nProject Context:        1KB\nAgent Memory (8 agents): 17KB × 8 = 136KB\nCoordination:           13KB\nArtifacts:              53KB\n─────────────────────────────\nTotal per project:     ~203KB\n```\n\n#### **Medium Project (E-commerce):**\n```\nProject Context:        2KB\nAgent Memory (8 agents): 25KB × 8 = 200KB\nCoordination:           25KB\nArtifacts:              100KB\n─────────────────────────────\nTotal per project:     ~327KB\n```\n\n#### **Large Project (Enterprise):**\n```\nProject Context:        5KB\nAgent Memory (8 agents): 50KB × 8 = 400KB\nCoordination:           50KB\nArtifacts:              200KB\n─────────────────────────────\nTotal per project:     ~655KB\n```\n\n### **Redis Memory Requirements**\n\n#### **Development (10 projects):**\n```\nSmall projects (5):     203KB × 5 = 1MB\nMedium projects (3):    327KB × 3 = 1MB\nLarge projects (2):     655KB × 2 = 1.3MB\nRedis overhead:         ~0.5MB\n─────────────────────────────\nTotal:                  ~3.8MB\n```\n\n#### **Production (100 projects):**\n```\nSmall projects (60):    203KB × 60 = 12MB\nMedium projects (30):   327KB × 30 = 10MB\nLarge projects (10):    655KB × 10 = 6.5MB\nRedis overhead:         ~5MB\n─────────────────────────────\nTotal:                  ~33.5MB\n```\n\n#### **Enterprise (1000 projects):**\n```\nSmall projects (600):   203KB × 600 = 122MB\nMedium projects (300):  327KB × 300 = 98MB\nLarge projects (100):   655KB × 100 = 66MB\nRedis overhead:         ~50MB\n─────────────────────────────\nTotal:                  ~336MB\n```\n\n## **Redis Configuration**\n\n### **Minimal Setup:**\n```bash\n# .env\nREDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379\nREDIS_PASSWORD=\nREDIS_DB=0\nREDIS_MAX_MEMORY=100MB\n```\n\n### **Production Setup:**\n```bash\n# .env.production\nREDIS_URL=redis://your-redis-server:6379\nREDIS_PASSWORD=your-secure-password\nREDIS_DB=0\nREDIS_MAX_MEMORY=1GB\nREDIS_EVICTION_POLICY=allkeys-lru  # Remove old projects when full\n```\n\n### **Memory Optimization:**\n```javascript\n// Automatic cleanup of old projects\nclass ContextManager {\n  async cleanupOldProjects() {\n    const projects = await redis.keys('project:*');\n    \n    for (const projectKey of projects) {\n      const created = await redis.hget(projectKey, 'created');\n      const age = Date.now() - new Date(created).getTime();\n      \n      // Remove projects older than 30 days\n      if (age > 30 * 24 * 60 * 60 * 1000) {\n        const projectId = projectKey.split(':')[1];\n        await this.clearProject(projectId);\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## **File Generation Statistics**\n\n### **Typical Project Output:**\n```\nBlog Project:\n├── 1 Prisma schema\n├── 8 API routers\n├── 15 React components\n├── 5 test suites\n├── 3 config files\n└── 1 documentation\n─────────────────\nTotal: ~33 files, ~50KB code\n```\n\n### **Storage Requirements:**\n```\nCode files:           50KB per project\nAgent memory:         203KB per project (Redis)\nCoordination logs:    13KB per project (Redis)\n─────────────────────────────\nTotal per project:    ~266KB\n```\n\n**For 100 projects: ~26MB total storage**\n**Redis memory needed: ~34MB**\n\n**Recommended Redis setup: 100MB for development, 1GB for production**\n\nShould I implement this context system with these specifications?"
