    "# Directory Structure & Redis Schema\n\n## **Project Directory Structure**\n\n```\ndhrit/\n├── mcp-server/\n│   ├── context/                    # Context management system\n│   │   ├── project-context.js      # Shared project state\n│   │   ├── agent-context.js        # Agent-specific memory\n│   │   ├── dependency-resolver.js  # Auto agent coordination\n│   │   └── context-manager.js      # Context orchestration\n│   ├── agents/                     # 8 AI agents\n│   │   ├── kosh-agent.js           # Database design\n│   │   ├── mool-agent.js           # Backend APIs\n│   │   ├── roop-agent.js           # Frontend UI\n│   │   ├── dhar-agent.js           # DevOps/Testing\n│   │   ├── pal-agent.js            # Architecture\n│   │   ├── kalp-agent.js           # Design system\n│   │   ├── bandh-agent.js          # Security\n│   │   └── gati-agent.js           # Performance\n│   ├── projects/                   # Generated projects\n│   │   └── {project-id}/\n│   │       ├── code/               # Actual Next.js project\n│   │       │   ├── src/\n│   │       │   │   ├── server/api/ # Generated by Mool\n│   │       │   │   ├── components/ # Generated by Roop\n│   │       │   │   └── lib/\n│   │       │   ├── prisma/         # Generated by Kosh\n│   │       │   ├── tests/          # Generated by Dhar\n│   │       │   └── package.json\n│   │       ├── architecture/       # Generated by Pal\n│   │       ├── design/             # Generated by Kalp\n│   │       ├── security/           # Generated by Bandh\n│   │       ├── performance/        # Generated by Gati\n│   │       └── coordination/       # Agent communication logs\n│   └── server.js                   # MCP server\n└── .env                           # Redis connection\n```\n\n## **Generated Project Files**\n\n### **Kosh (Database) Generates:**\n```\nprojects/{project-id}/code/\n├── prisma/\n│   ├── schema.prisma              # Main database schema\n│   ├── migrations/                # Database migrations\n│   └──